# + show notes uploaded by MJSullivan. Real, direct WWNS pipeline value:
# closes a repeat-guest coverage gap AND serves the Monetary/Growth WWNS
# category (candidate #8, the Brookings federal debt piece) more
# precisely than any other episode currently in this graph — the debt/
# disinflationary-offsets discussion here is essentially a real, expert
